[
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "【注】注意和例8的区别.例8中不能求出A的具体特征值.",
        "bbox": [
            131,
            79,
            658,
            97
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例20【解】（1）因A中有二阶子式非零，于是",
        "bbox": [
            132,
            128,
            556,
            148
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "img_path": "images/23e8bf77bd54f0f0e9225c299836e7f0195c2176c41779ad8dd7dcc7cbcf90ab.jpg",
        "text": "$$\nr(\\boldsymbol{A}) = 2 \\Leftrightarrow \\left| \\boldsymbol{A} \\right| = 0,\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            284,
            156,
            484,
            174
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "而 $\\begin{vmatrix} 1 & a & - 1 \\\\ a & 3 & 1 \\\\ - 1 & 1 & 1 \\end{vmatrix} = - (a + 1)^{2}$ ,所以 $a = -1$",
        "bbox": [
            132,
            179,
            529,
            244
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(2)由A的特征多项式",
        "bbox": [
            132,
            252,
            334,
            268
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "img_path": "images/cabeb5168b31cc40654d05cc52ed9afb32bc782fb2cdbc2c14daab3c03c9d6c6.jpg",
        "text": "$$\n\\left| \\lambda \\boldsymbol{E} - \\boldsymbol{A} \\right| = \\left| \\begin{matrix} \\lambda - 1 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & \\lambda - 3 & - 1 \\\\ 1 & - 1 & \\lambda - 1 \\end{matrix} \\right| = \\lambda (\\lambda - 1) (\\lambda - 4)   ,\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            139,
            275,
            628,
            341
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "得到A的特征值：1,4,0.",
        "bbox": [
            129,
            347,
            344,
            363
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "对 $\\lambda_{1} = 1$ ,由 $(E - A)x = 0$ 得特征向量 $\\boldsymbol{a}_{1} = (-1, -1, 1)^{\\mathrm{T}}$",
        "bbox": [
            129,
            370,
            657,
            388
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "对 $\\lambda_{2} = 4$ ,由 $(4E - A)x = 0$ 得特征向量 $\\boldsymbol{a}_{2}=(-1,2,1)^{\\mathrm{T}}$",
        "bbox": [
            131,
            395,
            643,
            412
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "对 $\\lambda_{3} = 0$ ,由 $\\left( 0 \\boldsymbol{E} - \\boldsymbol{A} \\right) \\boldsymbol{x} = \\boldsymbol{0}$ 得特征向量 $\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{3} = (1,0,1)^{\\mathrm{T}}$",
        "bbox": [
            129,
            419,
            625,
            436
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "因实对称矩阵的特征值不同，特征向量已相互正交，单位化后有",
        "bbox": [
            131,
            443,
            675,
            461
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "img_path": "images/ac6df65354f89d9c4d64e67b806fd75b0c8414408ddd605a55dc91d77bd5f44e.jpg",
        "text": "$$\n\\gamma_{1}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\left[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}\\right], \\gamma_{2}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{6}}\\left[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}\\right], \\gamma_{3}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\left[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}\\right].\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            188,
            467,
            576,
            532
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$\\boldsymbol{Q}=\\left(\\boldsymbol{\\gamma}_{1}, \\boldsymbol{\\gamma}_{2}, \\boldsymbol{\\gamma}_{3}\\right)=\\left[\\begin{aligned}&-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}} & -\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{6}} & \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\\\&-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}} & \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{6}} & 0 \\\\&\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}} & \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{6}} & \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\end{aligned}\\right]$ ,则 $Q^{-1}AQ = \\boldsymbol{\\Lambda} = \\begin{bmatrix} 1 & & \\\\ & 4 & \\\\ & & 0 \\end{bmatrix}.$",
        "bbox": [
            95,
            538,
            675,
            665
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "本章作业超链接 《基础过关660题》优选",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
